<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 89,807.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 89,807.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Jan 9 totaled 89,807 bales, up from 89,475 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,750 bales issued, no decertification orders, 1,418 cancellations, and 1,927 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
